==Other Changes==
* Corrected the 42 Mining ‘requirement’ for What Lies Below to be a recommendation.
* The issues with the Divine Rune Pouch (t), including the visibility bug in the 4th slot and the issue where the ZMI payment menu wouldn’t highlight correctly, have been fixed.
* You may now reclaim the Darkness of Hallowvale reward tome after completing A Taste of Hope from the chest located at the Burgh de Rott hideout… if you like.
* Fixed some incorrectly formatted dialogue in the Big Chompy Bird Hunting quest.
* The world switcher now displays all worlds correctly for players who have opted out of Fresh Start Worlds.
* MOBILE ONLY: Optimised the on-tap highlights to help with framerate dropping issues.
* STEAM ONLY: Tooltips will no longer be cut off on the right side of the screen.

==PvP Rota Changes==
The PvP rota has moved to '''Period A''':
* 539 - (US) - PvP World
* 548 - (Germany) - High-Risk PvP World
* 577 - (US) - Free-to-Play PvP World
* 559 - (UK) - LMS Competitive

World 390 (AUS) for LMS Competitive has been '''deactivated''' with this rota.


The PvP Arena is using ''''Max/Med'''' loadouts in Ranked Duels and Tournaments this week.
